    "message": "Defer a temporary exit or transfer until the person is free\n\nAn approved exit or transfer of someone who was queued, being served,\nmoving or waiting for support failed at once with a message saying it\nwas deferred, and never happened (#181). At the fork minute of the\ngenerated Scenario that was 19 of 20 people.\n\nRetry it next minute instead, as an approved departure of residents\nalready does: the departure retry becomes schedule_population_retry,\nkeeping its event IDs, and presence commands use it with their own\nprefix. Each waiting minute is recorded as suppressed with the reason.\nA temporary exit still waiting at its expected return minute is dropped\nas suppressed rather than failed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
